<title>FINLAND: NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP TEAM SKI JUMPING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP TEAM SKI JUMPING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LAHTI, Finland 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in a</p>
<p>World Cup team ski jumping event on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Finland (Ari Pekka Nikkola, Jani Soininen, Mika Laitinen,</p>
<p>    Janne Ahonen)						 945 points</p>
<p>2. Austria (Andreas Widhoelzl, Martin Hoellwarth, Stefan</p>
<p>    Horngacher, Andreas Goldberger)			 883</p>
<p>3. Norway (Simen Berntzen, Roar Ljoekelsoey, Haavard Lie, Lasse</p>
<p>    Ottesen)							858.3</p>
<p>4. Japan (Takanobu Okabe, Kazuyoshi Funaki, Masahiko Harada,</p>
<p>    Hitoya Saitoh)						846.8</p>
<p>5. Germany (Christoph Duffner, Ralph Gebstedt, Hansjoerg</p>
<p>    Jaekle, Dieter Thoma)				     821.4</p>
<p>Standings (after 21 events):</p>
<p>1. Japan</p>
<p>2. Finland</p>
<p>3. Norway</p>
<p>4. Austria</p>
<p>5. Germany</p>
